 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Budgets API (2016-10-20). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Budgets are stored definitions: no cost, usage, reservation or Savings Plans data is read, so CalculatedSpend, forecasts and health status are never reported, and the time period, cost types and auto-adjustment are not filled in with service defaults. CalculatedSpend, HealthStatus, AutoAdjustData, FilterExpression, BillingViewArn, LastUpdatedTime and notifications with subscribers are refused; ShowFilterExpression is accepted because no filter expression is stored. UpdateBudget changes only the members supplied in NewBudget. Notifications, subscribers, budget actions, performance history and action histories return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501, so no email or SNS notification is sent and no IAM, SCP or Systems Manager action runs.",
  "title": "AWS Budgets (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2016-10-20"
 },
